how do I find my passion this is a  critical question for any entrepreneur  because it is the most important rule in  business if you're not passionate about  your company you're not going to be  successful  bottom line none of the other rules  advice information tips will help you if  you're not passionate about your company  the reason is you kind of have to be a  little crazy to be an entrepreneur  because people gonna tell you you're  nuts you're not gonna see any momentum  for a while you're gonna be investing  everything you've got into your company  and constantly worried that it's not  gonna work out because it takes way  longer than you think it's gonna be even  though you know it's gonna be hard I'm  going to take a lot of yourself it's  gonna be way harder and take more of you  than you ever thought possible and  you're gonna think about quitting and  giving up so many times and the other  thing that gets you through is the  passion for what you're doing if you  look at any famous entrepreneur and why  they got started it's because they'd  loved what they did and they would do it  even if they weren't getting paid to do  it a lot of them didn't even think it  would ever become a business they don't  like the business side of it because  they'd love what they did is it's only  that passion that's going to get you  through all the tough times ahead so I  got a question from one of my readers on  my newsletter I'm Misha I mean she wrote  this crazy long email here trying to  find her passion and I get it I mean  this is great this is a great start a  mission for anybody who is thinking  about starting the business this is  important this is where you need to  start if you don't know what your  passion is don't start a business yet  okay now I have an entire zuga guide  that I walk people through how to find  their passion I'm gonna try to condense  that it's quick video for you guys I  mean she writes to say she likes special  education  she likes helping teach kids she likes  psychologies not sure how to bring this  all together  okay I'm Misha here's how you start you  start by making a list of all the things  all the things that you love doing it  okay forget about the business for now  just things that you love doing things  you can get lost in so if it's helping  these kids  it was researching about these kids if  it's finding a solution what  where it is what do you love what can  you get lost in you know for me it was  famous entrepreneur stories I love that  stuff  I could read a biography or a quick  overview of a famous entrepreneur and I  just love it I love it I love seeing it  I get lost and I can spend hours doing  it still now I can watch your videos  that inspire me I still love those  things  and so I had to find a way to make that  into a business what do you love what is  it that you love about kids and teaching  kids or both special needs kids  what is it make a list once you've  identified some of those things and you  can try to match it up to business  opportunity and remember the business  you don't have to be complicated okay  business comes from providing value the  more value give to somebody the more  money you're gonna make you want to make  a lot of money provide a lot of value  you want to make a lot of money quickly  provide a lot of value quickly that's it  this stuff that you love doing how does  it help people the more it helps people  the more money you can be able to charge  for it the more money you're gonna be  able to make that's the intersection  you're looking for something you love  doing with something that helps people  that's how you make a lot of money  that's how you find your winning  business idea okay if you're still not  sure once you get to that point instead  of just starting out putting whatever  job you have right now go work for  somebody who's done it go work for  somebody who is doing what you want to  do or close to what you want to do  there's a couple reasons for it okay  the first is you're gonna learn if  you're taking a job you want to take a  job to learn not just to get paid but to  learn right so if you go work for a  small company say look somebody has 10  employees who's doing something that is  inspiring to you you're gonna learn from  them and and try to take on more  responsibilities and what they've hired  you for any entrepreneur is looking for  star employees they want people to do  more to take on more because every  entrepreneur has tons of work so get  involved get closely the entrepreneur  learn from them it's like you're getting  paid to go to university you're getting  paid to make mistakes somebody else is  paying you to learn about the business  that you want to start and it also lets  you see is this the type of company you  want to start or not because a business  idea can sound great in your head and  then once you get into it you realize oh  this is not for me I don't want to do  this at all so why not get paid to learn  that and it's okay to bounce from one  thing to another thing to another thing  you know it in the eyes of society  they'll see you as a failure like you  can't keep a job down but you're  learning don't care what they think  you're learning you're finding your  passion you're finding something that  you're gonna be able to leverage and  change the world with that's your goal  and once you've done that once you've  found that job and and you're in there  you're hustling and you find out you  know I love this then you can start  thinking how can I turn this into my own  thing and you can start part-time start  on the side I don't want you to start a  job a business and I have to quit in  three months because you ran out of cash  so start part-time build connections  build it up to the point where you can  get to survival with your company and  then expand from there and that may be  the point where you can leave your job  and focus full-time but starting back at  the roots this is a great question every  entrepreneur should ask themselves this  how do I find my passion  am I really passionate about what I'm  doing because if you're not quit now  start something else because I'm I can't  help you if you're just asking how to  make money and you don't love your  business it's not gonna happen you're  gonna have more happiness more  fulfillment make more money have a  greater impact if you do something that  you're passionate about so just remember  that concept you're marrying what you  love to do with what can help people  that's how you're gonna find your  winning business idea again I have the  Zuka guide that walks through that  process step-by-step I tried to do it  quick justice in this video but I  hopefully that helped you I'm excited  for your journey believe for those of  you watching if you like the video  please give it a thumbs up below it  always makes you want to do more for you  and I want to hear what you have to  think how did you find your passion do  you have a question for me that I can  answer leave it in the comments below on  the video response thank you so much and  I'll see you soon
 

